---
---

<section class="py-24 relative bg-yorik-bg border-b border-yorik-border/50 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow background -->
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-yorik-purple/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text content side -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-left">
        
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-yorik-surface border border-yorik-purple/30">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-yorik-purple animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-yorik-purple-glow uppercase">
            BUILT BY ONE. DRIVEN BY PURPOSE.
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
          One developer. <span class="text-gradient-purple">One big idea.</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-base text-yorik-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Yorik Labs started as a solo journey with a simple belief: useful technology should be accessible, intuitive and built around real human needs.
          </p>
          <p>
            Instead of building massive monolithic applications packed with unnecessary bloat, Yorik Labs crafts razor-sharp tools designed for specific daily challenges. The ecosystem starts small — one product, one problem and one idea at a time.
          </p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">
            The ambition is much bigger.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-yorik-purple-dark to-yorik-purple hover:from-yorik-purple hover:to-yorik-purple-glow shadow-glow transition-all hover:scale-[1.02]"
          >
            <span>Follow the Journey</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Visual Card Side -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-3xl border border-yorik-purple/40 relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl space-y-6">
          
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-yorik-bg border border-yorik-purple/50 flex items-center justify-center p-1 shadow-glow">
              <img src="/logo.png" alt="Yorik Labs Brand Icon" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Independent Innovation</h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-yorik-cyan">Agile • Uncompromised Quality</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 text-xs text-yorik-muted">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-yorik-bg/80 border border-yorik-border/60">
              <span class="font-mono text-yorik-subtle">Philosophy</span>
              <span class="text-white font-medium">Focused Tools &gt; Bloated Apps</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-yorik-bg/80 border border-yorik-border/60">
              <span class="font-mono text-yorik-subtle">Architecture</span>
              <span class="text-yorik-purple-glow font-medium">Modular Utility Ecosystem</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-yorik-bg/80 border border-yorik-border/60">
              <span class="font-mono text-yorik-subtle">Privacy Guarantee</span>
              <span class="text-yorik-cyan font-medium">Local-First Encryption</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-yorik-purple/10 border border-yorik-purple/30 text-xs text-yorik-purple-glow italic">
            "Software should feel like an empowering tool built specifically for you — not an ad network disguised as an app."
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
